<p>Take aim and unload up to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">9, 12, 13, 15, 16</acronym> shots for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">75%, 90%, 101%, 111%, 120%</acronym> weapon damage each against random enemies inside a cone. Each enemy can only be hit once (twice for talent level 3 and higher). Using Swift Shot lowers the cooldown by 1.</p>